WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:04.180
FuelSeek automatically creates an
optimized fuel plan based on your route,
helping

2
00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:06.180
you save money on every load.

3
00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:10.180
Simply enter your pickup and delivery
locations, then click the FuelSeek button.

4
00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:14.660
In seconds, FuelSeek generates both the
best and worst fuel plans, so you can

5
00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:18.180
clearly see how much you save by following
the recommended plan.

6
00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:21.990
FuelSeek shows your current fuel level and
how much to fuel up at each stop, along

7
00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:23.180
with the cost per gallon.

8
00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:27.624
Click on any icon to view more details
such as the fuel pump location and savings

9
00:00:27.624 --> 00:00:28.180
per gallon.

10
00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:34.513
Every time you add a load in Spotter TMS,
a fuel plan is automatically created for

11
00:00:34.513 --> 00:00:36.180
you, no extra steps required.

12
00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:41.635
And if you prefer more control, you can
easily create your own fuel plan by

13
00:00:41.635 --> 00:00:44.180
unticking the simulation checkbox and
clicking FuelSeek.

14
00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:49.780
FuelSeek displays all fuel stations along
your route and lets you filter by retail

15
00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:52.180
price, discounted price, or total savings.

16
00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:56.860
With FuelSeek, smarter fueling decisions
are built into your workflow, saving
money,

17
00:00:56.860 --> 00:01:00.760
improving efficiency, and putting more
earnings to the driver's pocket.

